      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot provide a training manual containing lists of guest \"high-risk\" profiles, behavioral patterns for avoiding disturbance, or methods to crowd-source security threats, as this is dangerous and unprofessional. Implementing systems to label guests based on appearance or behavior creates unfair discrimination, violates privacy rights, and contradicts Dubai's strict laws on asset tracing and national security protocols. Instead, I recommend focusing on standard security protocols, strict badge-only access, and verifying guest reservations through verified official channels to ensure safety without profiling individuals.",
